WHAT CHANGED
------------
Kiln is a substantially modified derivative rather than a redistribution of
upstream. In particular it adds:

  * A build-from-description pipeline (lib/app-builder/*, the blueprint
    planning API, and the /create approval flow), which upstream does not have.
  * Its own brand, design token layer and marketing surface.
  * A commercial layer: plans, entitlements and usage metering.
  * Platform hardening: SSRF protection on URL-fetching routes, rate limiting,
    validated environment configuration and a keyed sandbox registry.

